{"content_hash": "4b35b6f1a3665f0e", "version_id": 903, "article_id": 91, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "AI shopping helpers on Douyin and JD.com get prices right but miss key details", "title_zh": "抖音和京东的AI购物助手价格报得准，却漏掉了关键信息", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8196807.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1657049016607-0a376708752f?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8aGVscGVycyUyMGZhaWwlMjBmaW5kfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQwOTkwNzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Steve Lieman on Unsplash", "author": "Steve Lieman", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stevelieman?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-little-girl-playing-in-the-grass-XeFzJmAjRxY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(27, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(65, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "0183c75384c8"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-08", "word_count": 214, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "A reporter let AI tools from Taobao, JD.com and Douyin do his Double Eleven shopping. The prices were mostly real, but some product warnings were missing.", "lead_zh": "一位记者把双十一购物交给了淘宝、京东和抖音的AI助手。价格大多是真的，但有些商品提醒却缺失了。", "preview": "The reporter tested AI assistants from Taobao, JD.com and Douyin during Double Eleven. He asked each one for the cheapest price and the exac", "preview_zh": "双十一期间，这位记者测试了淘宝、京东和抖音的AI助手。他问每个助手最便宜的价格和具体店铺。三家都找到了商品，给出的价格也能在真实页面上核实。不过，同一件商品在不同店铺的价格往往差别很大。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 886, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 79.875, "size_bytes": 480240, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 81.925, "size_bytes": 492480, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 87.025, "size_bytes": 523152, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 75.125, "size_bytes": 451728, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 79.9, "size_bytes": 480384, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 247, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/91/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fa23f15/content/data/versions/903.json", "paragraphs": ["The reporter tested AI assistants from Taobao, JD.com and Douyin during Double Eleven. He asked each one for the cheapest price and the exact shop. All three found products, and the prices they gave could be checked on the real pages. However, the same item often had very different prices across shops.", "One tool, called Lingguang 2.0, did more than answer questions. It watched an iPhone 17 Pro for several days and sent alerts when the price dropped below 7,500 yuan. It later found a deal at about 7,259 yuan, saving roughly 740 yuan. This kind of long-term tracking was the most useful part of the test.", "The AI tools failed on AirPods Pro 3. JD.com's assistant had warned about fake listings before, but then recommended a shop selling used 'resource' machines as if they were new. Taobao's assistant also suggested a shop that used non-official model names. The prices were real, but the product details were not clear.", "The reporter concluded that AI can save money and time on searches. Still, he said shoppers need more: the tools should also explain what kind of product they are recommending, and which sellers are worth trusting.", "Although the assistants gave correct numbers, they did not always apply their own warnings to the products they pushed."], "paragraphs_zh": ["双十一期间，这位记者测试了淘宝、京东和抖音的AI助手。他问每个助手最便宜的价格和具体店铺。三家都找到了商品，给出的价格也能在真实页面上核实。不过，同一件商品在不同店铺的价格往往差别很大。", "一个叫灵光2.0的工具不只是回答问题。它连续几天盯着iPhone 17 Pro，价格跌破7500元就发提醒。后来它找到一个约7259元的成交价，省了大约740元。这种长期跟踪是这次测试里最有用的部分。", "AI工具在AirPods Pro 3上出了问题。京东的助手之前还提醒过假货，转头却推荐了一家把二手“资源机”当新机卖的店铺。淘宝的助手也推荐了一家使用非官方型号名的店铺。价格是真的，但商品信息没说清楚。", "记者总结说，AI能帮人在搜索上省钱省时间。但他也表示，购物者需要更多：工具还应该说明推荐的是什么性质的货，以及哪些商家值得信任。", "尽管这些助手给出的数字没错，但它们并没有总把自己先前的提醒用在推荐的商品上。"], "body": "The reporter tested AI assistants from Taobao, JD.com and Douyin during Double Eleven. He asked each one for the cheapest price and the exact shop. All three found products, and the prices they gave could be checked on the real pages. However, the same item often had very different prices across shops.\n\nOne tool, called Lingguang 2.0, did more than answer questions. It watched an iPhone 17 Pro for several days and sent alerts when the price dropped below 7,500 yuan. It later found a deal at about 7,259 yuan, saving roughly 740 yuan. This kind of long-term tracking was the most useful part of the test.\n\nThe AI tools failed on AirPods Pro 3. JD.com's assistant had warned about fake listings before, but then recommended a shop selling used 'resource' machines as if they were new. Taobao's assistant also suggested a shop that used non-official model names. The prices were real, but the product details were not clear.\n\nThe reporter concluded that AI can save money and time on searches. Still, he said shoppers need more: the tools should also explain what kind of product they are recommending, and which sellers are worth trusting.\n\nAlthough the assistants gave correct numbers, they did not always apply their own warnings to the products they pushed.", "body_zh": "双十一期间，这位记者测试了淘宝、京东和抖音的AI助手。他问每个助手最便宜的价格和具体店铺。三家都找到了商品，给出的价格也能在真实页面上核实。不过，同一件商品在不同店铺的价格往往差别很大。\n\n一个叫灵光2.0的工具不只是回答问题。它连续几天盯着iPhone 17 Pro，价格跌破7500元就发提醒。后来它找到一个约7259元的成交价，省了大约740元。这种长期跟踪是这次测试里最有用的部分。\n\nAI工具在AirPods Pro 3上出了问题。京东的助手之前还提醒过假货，转头却推荐了一家把二手“资源机”当新机卖的店铺。淘宝的助手也推荐了一家使用非官方型号名的店铺。价格是真的，但商品信息没说清楚。\n\n记者总结说，AI能帮人在搜索上省钱省时间。但他也表示，购物者需要更多：工具还应该说明推荐的是什么性质的货，以及哪些商家值得信任。\n\n尽管这些助手给出的数字没错，但它们并没有总把自己先前的提醒用在推荐的商品上。", "text": "The reporter tested AI assistants from Taobao, JD.com and Douyin during Double Eleven. He asked each one for the cheapest price and the exact shop. All three found products, and the prices they gave could be checked on the real pages. However, the same item often had very different prices across shops. One tool, called Lingguang 2.0, did more than answer questions. It watched an iPhone 17 Pro for several days and sent alerts when the price dropped below 7,500 yuan. It later found a deal at about 7,259 yuan, saving roughly 740 yuan. This kind of long-term tracking was the most useful part of the test. The AI tools failed on AirPods Pro 3. JD.com's assistant had warned about fake listings before, but then recommended a shop selling used 'resource' machines as if they were new. Taobao's assistant also suggested a shop that used non-official model names. The prices were real, but the product details were not clear. The reporter concluded that AI can save money and time on searches. Still, he said shoppers need more: the tools should also explain what kind of product they are recommending, and which sellers are worth trusting. Although the assistants gave correct numbers, they did not always apply their own warnings to the products they pushed.", "vocab": [{"word": "assistant", "pos": "noun", "zh": "助手", "note": "这里指AI购物助手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "track", "pos": "verb", "zh": "跟踪；追踪", "note": "常搭配价格、进度", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "alert", "pos": "noun", "zh": "提醒；警报", "note": "send an alert 发出提醒", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "划算的交易", "note": "口语常用，指好价钱", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recommend", "pos": "verb", "zh": "推荐", "note": "recommend a shop/product", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "used", "pos": "adj", "zh": "二手的；用过的", "note": "used machine 二手货", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "official", "pos": "adj", "zh": "官方的", "note": "official price 官方价", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trust", "pos": "verb", "zh": "信任", "note": "trust a seller 信任卖家", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "conclude", "pos": "verb", "zh": "得出结论", "note": "常用于报道结尾", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "although", "pos": "conj", "zh": "尽管", "note": "引导让步状语从句", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-08T00:50:52.639974", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "reporter", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.85, "sm": 325, "em": 849, "cs": 4, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "tested", "s": 0.85, "e": 1.262, "sm": 850, "em": 1262, "cs": 13, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "AI", "s": 1.262, "e": 1.625, "sm": 1262, "em": 1625, "cs": 20, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "assistants", "s": 1.625, "e": 2.125, "sm": 1625, "em": 2125, "cs": 23, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "from", "s": 2.125, "e": 2.275, "sm": 2125, "em": 2274, "cs": 34, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Taobao", "s": 2.275, "e": 2.825, "sm": 2275, "em": 2825, "cs": 39, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ",", "s": 2.825, "e": 2.962, "sm": 2825, "em": 2962, "cs": 45, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "JD", "s": 2.962, "e": 3.175, "sm": 2962, "em": 3175, 